@startuml
title Preliminary Strijder power distribution
left to right direction
skinparam backgroundColor #0B0B0F
skinparam defaultFontColor #F4F1E8
skinparam ArrowColor #C89B3C
skinparam rectangleBorderColor #D8C184
skinparam rectangleBackgroundColor #171922
skinparam rectangleFontColor #F4F1E8

rectangle "Vehicle battery / ignition" as Battery
rectangle "Independent input fuse" as Fuse
rectangle "Reverse polarity, surge,\ninrush and filtering" as Protect
rectangle "UPS power path\n50-60 Wh usable target" as UPS
rectangle "Protected branch\nswitches / e-fuses" as Branch

rectangle "Vision Core\nplanning 30 W" as Core
rectangle "Windows + primary display\nplanning 20 W" as Display
rectangle "Main head + cameras\nplanning 12 W" as Cameras
rectangle "Aux display\nplanning 8 W" as Aux
rectangle "I/O + radios + sensors\nplanning 5 W" as IO
rectangle "Independent lighting\npower controller" as Lighting

Battery --> Fuse
Fuse --> Protect
Protect --> UPS
UPS --> Branch
Branch --> Core
Branch --> Display
Branch --> Cameras
Branch --> Aux
Branch --> IO
Fuse --> Lighting : separate high-current feed
IO --> Lighting : control / feedback only

note bottom of Branch
  Total planning load: 75 W
  Main feed: 2 positive + 2 return
  4.17 A/contact at 9 V ideal sharing
end note

note bottom of UPS
  75 W x 20 min = 25 Wh ideal
  Example discussed: 12.8 V, 6 Ah
  about 76.8 Wh nominal
end note
@enduml
